ys I’m depressed much of the time.","key":"GRnZWlONwd"}],"key":"Cp6wtdcREc"}],"key":"yGwprFSUYU"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Eliza: I am sorry to hear you are depressed","key":"k0TCXZ0naG"}],"key":"fNuaCu64Wh"}],"key":"daKaHfFAKa"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Human: It’s true. I am unhappy.","key":"H8HOPYEDWU"}],"key":"WbLETGYRAh"}],"key":"EfiISphl8g"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Eliza: Do you think coming here will help you not to be unhappy","key":"qgrkkeBJDk"}],"key":"gKrnmgxC8J"}],"key":"voWm9y1Qy3"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Human: I need some help, that much seems certain","key":"F0ledGkKgz"}],"key":"LDW635hksM"}],"key":"VZHCedMyBr"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Eliza: What would it mean to you if you got some help","key":"vndwfKdhS2"}],"key":"ayZyLYMhbu"}],"key":"nZq5vTynzz"}],"key":"Ro8mY1AqBb"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Text is from Weizenbaum, J. (1966). ","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"kMPFqloprH"},{"type":"cite","url":"https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/365153.365168","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"ELIZA—a computer program for the study of natural language communication between man and machine","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"M61WUuNi8v"}],"kind":"narrative","label":"Weizenbaum_1966","identifier":"https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/365153.365168","enumerator":"1","key":"PWKdwBrDMI"},{"type":"text","value":". ","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"xkoEjyfshE"},{"type":"emphasis","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Communications of the ACM","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"NLaQnKDIue"}],"key":"NL1IGrkmwR"},{"type":"text","value":", 9(1), 36-45.","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"eVAtSsAZCY"}],"key":"lWQ54FtMmz"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can see that you can create the answers by using pattern matching, introducing things like “I am sorry you are X”, when X is in a pre-defined list of negative mental states.","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"hWaGID4pbR"}],"key":"ttAWiE5VaG"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Today, chatbots range from speech-to-speech systems like Siri, Alexa, Cortana and the like, to text-based chatbots that you may find on your bank’s website. Full conversational systems like Siri need to incorporate speech processing, language understanding, plus a way of getting answers to you (usually by searching the web). Customer service chatbots just need a language model to understand and generate language, plus a database that contains company information that the customer may need.","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"q4pJFNSMHq"